      "title": "Note: Model Links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Required models\n\n**models/diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n**models/text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n**models/vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n**models/loras**\n\n- [minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/larryvrh/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora/resolve/main/minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema.safetensors)\n\n## Required nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI: `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI)\n- [ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Turbo: `MiniMaxH3TurboLoRA`](https://github.com/Larryvrh/ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Turbo)\n- [ComfyUI-SolAttn_triton: `SolAttnPatch`](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-SolAttn_triton)\n\nLoad this JSON in ComfyUI. Use ComfyUI Manager for missing custom nodes; update ComfyUI when a core node is missing. Put each model in the folder shown above, restart ComfyUI, and reload the workflow."
      ],
